  "slug": "google-workspace-mcp",
  "name": "Google Workspace Mcp",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "MCP server for Google Workspace: Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Docs, and Sheets integration for Claude.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 hook**, `SessionStart` and **1 MCP server**, `google-workspace`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install google-workspace-mcp@claude-community` from `adelaidasofia/google-workspace-mcp`.\n\nMulti-account, token-efficient MCP for Gmail + Calendar + Drive + Docs + Sheets. Built because the official Claude connector supports one account and returns full message/file bodies by default.",
